    mem:rationale """Walking the whole flagged resource (per the skill: a stale seeAlso often sits beside a stale hasResource), the prof:hasResource list names </vault/meta/profiles/source> — a 404. The meta/profiles/ container listing (ground truth) holds concept, working, page, organization, template, event, howto, thing, person, place — no 'source'. This is the same D98 sources->concepts merge as finding 01, surfacing in the PROF descriptor layer: the source profile was removed when wiki:Source folded into the concept profile (Type Index routes wiki:Source -> concepts/). Repair: drop the dead prof:hasResource -> profiles/source term. Same static-config home as finding 01, so a REPO edit, not an N3 Patch. NOTE for the auditor: pod_audit.py should extend its resolve check to prof:hasResource / prof:hasRole targets, not just rdfs:seeAlso — this finding and finding 03 both escaped it.""" ;
